sequenceDiagram
    title LedgerLogic: sign-in and adding a transaction (traced from the running app)
    actor User
    participant FE as React frontend<br/>Login.jsx<br/>TransactionForm<br/>api.js, token.js
    participant BE as Backend API<br/>authenticate<br/>routes<br/>services
    participant DB as Database<br/>repositories<br/>SQLite

    rect rgb(240, 247, 243)
    Note over User,DB: Sign-in
    User->>FE: 1. Enter email and password, select Log In
    FE->>BE: 2. POST /api/auth/login { email, password }
    BE->>DB: 3. Find user by email
    DB-->>BE: 4. User with password hash
    Note over BE: 5. bcrypt.compare,<br/>sign a one-day JWT
    alt Wrong email or password
        BE-->>FE: 401 { error }
        FE-->>User: Show "Incorrect email or password."
    else Correct
        BE-->>FE: 6. 200 { token, user }
        Note over FE: 7. Save token<br/>in localStorage
    end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 240)
    Note over User,DB: Add a transaction
    User->>FE: 8. Submit the income or expense form
    FE->>BE: 9. POST /api/transactions<br/>Authorization: Bearer token
    Note over BE: 10. Verify token,<br/>set req.userId
    alt Missing, invalid, or expired token
        BE-->>FE: 401 { error }
        Note over FE: Clear token,<br/>show login page
    else Valid token
        BE->>DB: 11. Find the category for this user
        DB-->>BE: 12. Category, or nothing
        alt Invalid data or not this user's category
            BE-->>FE: 400 { error, details }
            FE-->>User: Show the reasons on the form
        else Valid data
            BE->>DB: 13. INSERT with user_id from the token
            DB-->>BE: 14. Saved record
            BE-->>FE: 15. 201 saved transaction
            FE->>BE: 16. GET summary, transactions, categories,<br/>and spending report (each with the token)
            BE-->>FE: 17. 200 with this user's data only
            FE-->>User: 18. Totals, chart, bars, and list update
        end
    end
    end
